# SQL Analysis

This folder contains SQL scripts developed for the Hospital Management Data Analytics project.

## Analysis Areas

- Patient utilization and visit frequency
- Appointment operations and status analysis
- Doctor performance analysis
- Treatment and revenue analysis, where supported by the available data
- Data quality and operational insights

## Approach

Each analysis is designed to answer a specific business question using the actual tables and columns available in the dataset.

The findings will be documented with their business relevance and limitations.
